<title>FRANCE: French election - latest results at 1900 GMT.</title>
<headline>French election - latest results at 1900 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the latest state of the count in the first round of France's election for the 577-seat National Assembly, held on Sunday, according to the French Interior Ministry.</p>
<p>The first table gives the score in the outgoing parliament, seats won on the first round and candidates well-placed to win runoffs.</p>
<p>The second table gives the number of votes won and the percentage share of the national popular vote.</p>
<p>At the bottom of the tables are the figures for the number of registered voters and the turnout.</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SEATS		    outgoing seats   seats won</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		 0			0</p>
<p> Communists		   0			0</p>
<p> Socialists		   4			0</p>
<p> PRS*			   1			0</p>
<p> Other left		   1			0</p>
<p> Ecologists		   0			0</p>
<p> Independents		 0			0</p>
<p> RPR**			 15			3</p>
<p> UDF***			14			1</p>
<p> Other right		  1			1</p>
<p> National Front	     0			0</p>
<p> Extreme-right		0			0</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> TOTAL			 36			5</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> VOTES			 votes won	percentage</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Extreme left		 10,750		1.29</p>
<p> Communists		   65,965		7.94</p>
<p> Socialists		  169,043	     20.36</p>
<p> PRS			    12,250		1.47</p>
<p> Other left		   19,727		2.37</p>
<p> Ecologists		   48,892		5.89</p>
<p> Independents		 41,375		4.98</p>
<p> RPR			   154,065	     18.56</p>
<p> UDF			   122,327	     14.74</p>
<p> Other right		  78,845		9.50</p>
<p> National Front	    105,991	     12.77</p>
<p> Extreme-right		   634		0.07</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total electorate: 1,258,899   Turnout: 65.91 percent</p>
<p>*   Radical Socialist Party (centre-left)</p>
<p>**  Rally for the Republic (Gaullists, ruling coalition)</p>
<p>*** Union for French Democracy (centre-right, ruling coalition)</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 33+1 4221 5452</p>
